/* (hookshot) Ocarina of Time's teleport destinations: one list for the menu's Teleport page (menu.c, its cards and sections)
   and the game side (packs/oot/host/oot_teleport.c, the maps they load). Before game packs a4 these were two copies of one
   generated list (gpu/vk/vk_menu.cpp teleport_names and host/hos_main.c oot_destinations), generated by
   work/oot-teleport-tools/write_destinations.py; the order is the teleport action's index (OOT_TELEPORT_ACTION + it).
   OOT_SECTION(title) starts a section of the page; OOT_PLACE(name, note, child map, child start, child boot event, adult map,
   adult start, adult boot event): the card's name and tag (NULL none) and the map change for each age (a child map of NULL:
   the adult only). */
#pragma once

#define OOT_DESTINATIONS(OOT_SECTION, OOT_PLACE) \
    OOT_SECTION("Overworld") \
